{"id": "EUVD-2026-97625", "enisaUuid": "8f992a6a-84f2-3af5-a9fb-f21229f494e5", "description": "Grav Star Ratings 2.0.1 through 2.0.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows unauthenticated visitors to vote by bypassing client-only vote_access and readonly enforcement. Attackers can use the anonymous nonce emitted by getData() to submit votes directly to addVote(), manipulating restricted or disabled ratings and aggregate rating output.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:14", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T15:50:34", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-556j-6jh2-5rcv", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-star-ratings-2.0.1-through-2.0.3-missing-server-side-vote-access-authorization"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109323", "GHSA-pwp7-4hgc-rjhr"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "67b97a4e-3c99-3986-8eb1-59350bb8f4c9", "product": {"name": "grav-plugin-star-ratings", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "2.0.1 <2.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fb93a59c-676c-399e-bd95-f9f8b6ec895c", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}